{"vid":"mmfo9spNaWA","source":"mmfo9spNaWA.en-en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":2.9,"txt":"You're learning with nine to five English - business English for the workplace"},{"t":14.8,"txt":"Hi, Tim here with another [9] to [5] English lesson in"},{"t":20.8,"txt":"Today's lesson we're going to learn how to disagree with ideas"},{"t":27.2,"txt":"people disagree with each other's ideas all the [time] in fact"},{"t":33.7,"txt":"Disagreement isn't just natural"},{"t":36.2,"txt":"it's"},{"t":37.5,"txt":"necessary"},{"t":38.7,"txt":"How else can we sort out the good ideas from the bad ones?"},{"t":44.4,"txt":"But disagreeing with people isn't always easy"},{"t":48.6,"txt":"If you're not [careful], you [can] make people feel hurt or angry"},{"t":55.4,"txt":"So how can you do that? How can you tell someone you don't like their idea without upsetting them"},{"t":64.3,"txt":"well one thing you can do is avoid stating your disagreement too strongly for"},{"t":72.5,"txt":"Example you can say I'm not sure that's a good [idea]"},{"t":78.5,"txt":"What you're really saying is that it is not a good idea"},{"t":84.1,"txt":"But it's softer if you sound a bit unsure"},{"t":89,"txt":"the word might"},{"t":91.3,"txt":"Can work this way as well as in that"},{"t":95.7,"txt":"might not be the best way to go and"},{"t":100,"txt":"Notice that both these ways of disagreeing"},{"t":104.2,"txt":"focus on the idea"},{"t":106.6,"txt":"Not the person presenting the idea"},{"t":110.2,"txt":"focusing on the idea can help reduce the [risk] of upsetting the person you're disagreeing with"},{"t":118.2,"txt":"Another way to carefully disagree with an idea is to use a special"},{"t":124.4,"txt":"expression that softens your words a"},{"t":128.3,"txt":"Couple of good ones are to be honest"},{"t":132.6,"txt":"and"},{"t":133.4,"txt":"I'm afraid"},{"t":135.9,"txt":"Starting a sentence with these expressions can [help] your disagreement sound more polite"},{"t":143.9,"txt":"How about practicing these different ways to disagree?"},{"t":148.3,"txt":"You're going to hear some [examples]"},{"t":151.5,"txt":"after each example"},{"t":153.4,"txt":"try repeating it yourself"},{"t":156.5,"txt":"ready"},{"t":157.7,"txt":"Let's give it a go"},{"t":159.8,"txt":"I'm"},{"t":161.1,"txt":"Not sure that's the best option here"},{"t":169.3,"txt":"I'm afraid I don't totally agree with you"},{"t":178.4,"txt":"To be honest, I [think] that would be difficult"},{"t":187.7,"txt":"Well that might not be the best way to go"},{"t":197.1,"txt":"So we've [just] practiced some simple ways of disagreeing carefully"},{"t":203.9,"txt":"but there's another really effective way to disagree, and that's what I call the"},{"t":211.8,"txt":"yes, but"},{"t":213.8,"txt":"approach"},{"t":215.6,"txt":"with the yes, but approach you actually start by agreeing or"},{"t":222.8,"txt":"Saying something good about the idea"},{"t":227.1,"txt":"then you use the word but"},{"t":230.9,"txt":"To introduce your disagreement or the reason why you disagree?"},{"t":236.8,"txt":"for example you might say"},{"t":239.7,"txt":"good idea, but we don't have enough time or"},{"t":243.9,"txt":"you could say"},{"t":245.8,"txt":"Yes this option is cheaper, but it doesn't look very nice"},{"t":252.6,"txt":"Why is this yes, but approach effective?"},{"t":257.8,"txt":"Well it shows that you [have] an open mind"},{"t":261.6,"txt":"[I] mean if you can say something good about the person's idea"},{"t":267.6,"txt":"Then you've clearly thought carefully about it"},{"t":271.4,"txt":"You're not just disagreeing to be difficult or to start an argument"},{"t":277.8,"txt":"Now it's your turn to practice using the yes, but approach"},{"t":285.2,"txt":"Remember to repeat each example after you hear it"},{"t":291.4,"txt":"Good idea, but nobody has the time [to] make it happen"},{"t":301.4,"txt":"I see what you're saying, but I'm not sure I can agree"},{"t":313.1,"txt":"Although it costs less. I really don't think it's as good"},{"t":322.9,"txt":"okay, so we've practiced some different ways of"},{"t":327.4,"txt":"disagreeing carefully"},{"t":329.4,"txt":"But sometimes you don't want to be careful"},{"t":333.3,"txt":"sometimes"},{"t":334.4,"txt":"You want to make it very clear that you disagree?"},{"t":338.3,"txt":"And you're not worried about making someone feel bad in"},{"t":344.1,"txt":"This situation you can say what you think?"},{"t":348.2,"txt":"very directly and clearly"},{"t":351.1,"txt":"for example you might say"},{"t":354.2,"txt":"that's out of the question or"},{"t":357.7,"txt":"There's no way we could do that"},{"t":361.3,"txt":"Both of these expressions mean that something is impossible"},{"t":367.1,"txt":"Another way to disagree. Strongly is to ask a question like"},{"t":372.6,"txt":"Do you really think that would work?"},{"t":375.8,"txt":"What you really mean is"},{"t":378.6,"txt":"That won't work"},{"t":380.5,"txt":"But by asking a question like this"},{"t":383.6,"txt":"It makes it sound as if you're surprised that someone might actually believe it's a good idea"},{"t":391.9,"txt":"One more way of disagreeing. Strongly is to tell someone they must be kidding or"},{"t":399.8,"txt":"Joking of course the person isn't really joking but saying this"},{"t":406.6,"txt":"Makes it sound like their idea is terrible"},{"t":410.7,"txt":"Now let's practice these expressions"},{"t":413.9,"txt":"for disagreeing strongly"},{"t":417.3,"txt":"Once again repeat [the] examples after you hear them"},{"t":423.5,"txt":"Do you really think that would work?"},{"t":431.4,"txt":"That's out of the question"},{"t":438.3,"txt":"There's no way we could do that"},{"t":446,"txt":"You've got to be kidding"},{"t":452.6,"txt":"so we've learned some different ways of"},{"t":456.1,"txt":"disagreeing with ideas"},{"t":458.3,"txt":"but how do these expressions sound in the"},{"t":461.9,"txt":"conversation"},{"t":463.2,"txt":"Let's listen to a short dialogue between two co-workers"},{"t":468.9,"txt":"They're talking about whether or not they [should] hire a person named Jill"},{"t":477,"txt":"Okay, it's clear to me that we [should] hire Jill"},{"t":480.8,"txt":"I'm afraid I don't totally agree with that"},{"t":484.6,"txt":"Well, she's got a lot of experience. I know experience is important, but she's not a good fit"},{"t":493.7,"txt":"as you"},{"t":495.6,"txt":"[heard] the man disagrees carefully with the idea of hiring Jill"},{"t":501.9,"txt":"then when the woman mentions Jill's experience the man starts by acknowledging that"},{"t":509.6,"txt":"experience is important before he disagrees by using the word but"},{"t":517.3,"txt":"Now it's your turn to practice"},{"t":520.3,"txt":"Will repeat the dialogue, but this time we're going to beep out the second speaker's words"},{"t":527.8,"txt":"You will have to say those parts yourself"},{"t":531.9,"txt":"remember to start by disagreeing"},{"t":535.6,"txt":"carefully"},{"t":536.8,"txt":"Then you can use a yes, but approach to comment on Jill's experience"},{"t":546.5,"txt":"Okay, it's clear to me [that] we should hire Jill"},{"t":556.8,"txt":"Well, she's got a lot of experience"},{"t":567,"txt":"all right, we've learned some great ways to"},{"t":572,"txt":"disagree with people's ideas"},{"t":575.3,"txt":"carefully, and"},{"t":577.3,"txt":"we've also"},{"t":578.8,"txt":"practiced disagreeing strongly with ideas"},{"t":583.2,"txt":"Be sure to tune in next time when [we'll] start learning how to talk about your personal background"},{"t":591.8,"txt":"until then so long and happy learning"}],"words":[{"t":2.919,"w":"You're"},{"t":2.919,"w":"learning"},{"t":2.919,"w":"with"},{"t":2.919,"w":"nine"},{"t":2.919,"w":"to"},{"t":2.919,"w":"five"},{"t":2.919,"w":"English"},{"t":2.919,"w":"-"},{"t":2.919,"w":"business"},{"t":2.919,"w":"English"},{"t":2.919,"w":"for"},{"t":2.919,"w":"the"},{"t":2.919,"w":"workplace"},{"t":14.799,"w":"Hi,"},{"t":14.799,"w":"Tim"},{"t":14.799,"w":"here"},{"t":14.799,"w":"with"},{"t":14.799,"w":"another"},{"t":14.799,"w":"[9]"},{"t":14.79